# Weather World Scraper

This is my web scraping capstone project. I'm collecting weather data for cities around the world using Selenium, then cleaning it up with Pandas. Eventually I'll store it in a SQLite database and build an interactive dashboard with Streamlit to explore the data.

## How to run this

1. Clone this repo
2. Install the packages you need: pip install selenium webdriver-manager pandas
3. Run the scraper: python scraper.py
4. Clean up the data: python clean_data.py